472: // Returns the size of the internal back buffer (which is mostly the same as
473: // terminal's window size in characters). But it doesn't always match the size
474: // of the terminal window, after the terminal size has changed, the internal
475: // back buffer will get in sync only after Clear or Flush function calls.
476: func Size() (width int, height int) {
477: 	return termw, termh
478: }
